{"version":1,"content":"<p>據證券時報報道，OpenAI正在推進手機項目，富士康旗下富智康集團已獲得相關訂單，將參與產品的整機組裝。富智康集團主要從事移動終端等電子產品的製造服務，其母公司富士康也是蘋果iPhone的主要組裝商。如果上述供應鏈消息最終落地，意味着OpenAI的硬件佈局可能進一步延伸至智能手機，並與現有手機廠商圍繞AI交互入口展開更直接的競爭。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587088.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T05:43:54.875829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:33:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:14.223023+00:00","content_hash":"c44d6d75a5b8cfe5c9716c9c5eb3558a3f74a240397ddd3fbe46610e019aa6dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}